      "voiceId": "chris-williamson",
      "voiceName": "Chris Williamson",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Women feel much more negatively towards young men than young men feel about them.\n\n72% of men have a positive view of women.\n\n50% of women have a neutral or negative view of men.\n\n21% of women have an actively negative view of men.\n\nOnly 7% of men feel the same.\n\nFor all the talk about manosphere-inspired misogyny, 3x more women hold a negative view of men than men hold of women. \u2014 h/t @NewStatesman",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ChrisWillx/status/2048451460413673678",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-26T17:17:41+00:00",
